### 3.6c VIS04: material com textura mas sem mapa de cor (400 Bad Request, com o caminho em details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 9, "length": 1.4, "height": 2.6 },
    "elements": [
      {
        "id": "oven-01",
        "type": "wood-fired-oven",
        "position": { "x": 3.9, "y": 0.9, "z": 0.7 },
        "rotation": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 },
        "scale": { "x": 1, "y": 1, "z": 1 },
        "material": { "normalMap": "/textures/red_brick/normal.jpg" }
      }
    ]
  }
}
?? status == 400
?? js response.parsedBody.error.message.includes('/elements/0/material/colorMap') == true

### 3.7 Falha Schema: tipo de elemento desconhecido (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 12, "length": 30, "height": 4 },
    "elements": [
      {
        "id": "robot-01",
        "type": "robot",
        "modelReference": "/assets/models/robot.gltf",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 },
        "rotation": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 },
        "scale": { "x": 1, "y": 1, "z": 1 }
      }
    ]
  }
}
?? status == 400

### 3.8 ID com formato inválido (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/not-a-valid-id
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 400


### ==========================================
### 4: CRIAÇÃO E ATUALIZAÇÃO DE CONFIGURAÇÕES
### ==========================================

### 4.1 Criar Configuração A - Standard (201 Created)
# @name createConfigA
POST {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Standard Line {{dynamicSuffix}}",
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 12, "length": 30, "height": 4 },
    "elements": [
      {
        "id": "conveyor-01",
        "type": "assembly-line",
        "modelReference": "/assets/models/conveyor.gltf",
        "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 },
        "rotation": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 },
        "scale": { "x": 1, "y": 1, "z": 1 },
        "material": {
          "colorMap": "/textures/metal_plate/diffuse.jpg",
          "normalMap": "/textures/metal_plate/normal.jpg",
          "roughnessMap": "/textures/metal_plate/rough.jpg"
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
?? status == 201
?? js Object.hasOwn(response.parsedBody, 'isActive') == false
@configA_Id = {{createConfigA.id}}

### 4.2 Criar Configuração B - Full Line (201 Created)
# @name createConfigB
POST {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Full Line {{dynamicSuffix}}",
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 20, "length": 45, "height": 5 },
    "elements": []
  }
}
?? status == 201
@configB_Id = {{createConfigB.id}}

### 4.3 Atualizar o nome da Configuração B (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Full Line Rev2 {{dynamicSuffix}}"
}
?? status == 200
?? body id == {{configB_Id}}

### 4.4 Falha Joi: PATCH com body vazio (400 Bad Request)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
?? status == 400

### 4.5 Employee não consegue atualizar (403 Forbidden)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{empToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hacked"
}
?? status == 403


### ==========================================
### 5: REFERÊNCIA A PARTIR DA KITCHEN CONFIGURATION
### ==========================================

### 5.1 As linhas não têm estado ativo (o campo isActive não existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 200
?? js Object.hasOwn(response.parsedBody, 'isActive') == false

### 5.2 Kitchen com configurationId mal formado (400 Bad Request - schema da kitchen)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kitchen-configurations/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 20, "length": 40, "height": 4 },
    "elements": [],
    "assemblyLine": {
      "configurationId": "not-an-id",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": -15 },
      "rotation": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 }
    }
  }
}
?? status == 400

### 5.2b VIS04: chão da cozinha com textura (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kitchen-configurations/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 10, "length": 15, "height": 3 },
    "elements": [],
    "floor": {
      "material": {
        "colorMap": "/textures/tiled_floor_001/diffuse.jpg",
        "normalMap": "/textures/tiled_floor_001/normal.jpg",
        "roughnessMap": "/textures/tiled_floor_001/rough.jpg",
        "repeat": { "x": 6, "y": 10 }
      }
    }
  }
}
?? status == 200
?? body valid == true

### 5.3 Criar uma Kitchen Configuration que coloca a Linha B numa parede (201 Created)
# @name createKitchenWithLine
POST {{baseUrl}}/kitchen-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kitchen With Line {{dynamicSuffix}}",
  "content": {
    "dimensions": { "width": 20, "length": 40, "height": 4 },
    "elements": [],
    "assemblyLine": {
      "configurationId": "{{configB_Id}}",
      "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": -15 },
      "rotation": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 }
    },
    "floor": {
      "material": {
        "colorMap": "/textures/tiled_floor_001/diffuse.jpg",
        "normalMap": "/textures/tiled_floor_001/normal.jpg",
        "roughnessMap": "/textures/tiled_floor_001/rough.jpg",
        "repeat": { "x": 6, "y": 10 }
      }
    }
  }
}
?? status == 201
@kitchenWithLine_Id = {{createKitchenWithLine.id}}

### 5.4 Tentar eliminar a Linha B, referenciada pela kitchen (409 Conflict)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 409

### 5.5 Eliminar a Linha A, que ninguém referencia (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configA_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 204

### 5.6 Obter a Linha A (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configA_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 404

### 5.7 Employee não consegue eliminar (403 Forbidden)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{empToken}}
?? status == 403

### 5.8 Eliminar uma linha inexistente (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 404

### 5.9 A rota /active já não existe: 'active' é tratado como um ID inválido (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 400


### ==========================================
### 6: LIMPEZA
### ==========================================

### 6.1 Eliminar a kitchen que referencia a Linha B (204 No Content - está inativa)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/kitchen-configurations/{{kitchenWithLine_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 204

### 6.2 Sem referências, a Linha B já pode ser eliminada (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/assembly-line-configurations/{{configB_Id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
?? status == 204
